# which moved them to c590689d… / 5cdeafd0… on main; plan step A7 (the allele-frequency shapes step along the likelihood's own
# slope) moved them to these. Steps A6, A8 and the two checkpoint A' changes moved neither. The other five lines are unchanged.
# Window lines re-recorded 2026-09-29 after merging main (c37e14e9): main's psp format 1.1 (59454108) counts the reads the depth
# cap discarded into window depth and did not re-record them; they were 25d388c8… / 259baf04…. Step B1 moved no line.
# Fit lines re-recorded 2026-10-02 (fit_precision.md, plan step C3): the repeat-tract climb stops on Newton distances in its
# numbers' errors, with up to 40 rounds where it had 5; 50 of the file's 574 lines moved, all repeat-tract rows (37 slippage rows
# and 13 of the 15 fitted strata's length spectra), and 352 of 6,706 calls changed printed numbers only (AF in 324 by at most
# 0.043, 326 sample GQs by at most 2, QUAL in 193 by at most 0.5), no genotype, and no record appeared, vanished or changed its
# alleles. They were 393e7cd3… / 1f16dec8….
# Both parameters-file lines re-recorded 2026-10-06 (fit_precision.md, plan step E2): the file's format version 2 adds each
# number's standard error, the SNP/indel fit's starts and their notes. No number and no call moved: with every key and note
# version 2 added taken out, both files are the old ones line for line (each new key deleted from its row, each new note
# line dropped, the version put back, then compared). The fitted file gains
# 144 standard errors (4 multipliers, 4 inbreeding coefficients, 136 substitution rates; the other 52 rates are zero and carry
# none), one own-fit error (the one stratum of 37 whose level is its own fit) and three starts, all at the pass limit.
# They were 5e6d874d… / bf6b176a….
# Three lines re-recorded 2026-10-06 (fit_precision.md, checkpoint E): a repeat-tract substitution rate is never zero — a
# count with no mismatch takes half of one. 52 of the fitted file's 188 rates move (to 0.0010-0.014) and gain the
# standard error they lacked, so every rate now carries one; nothing else moves but notes; 4 of 6,706 calls with the fit move, all repeat tracts — QUAL by at most 0.4, AF by at most 0.00046
# — with no genotype changed and no record appearing or vanishing. The defaults run's file moves in 8 note lines.
